{"id":"1373468425","kind":"answer","title":"Anki 可以视为 supermemo 的开源实现吗，它们的差别还有多大？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复的历史","date":"2020-07-31","updated":"2020-07-31","votes":61,"comment_count":9,"minutes":3,"chars":1275,"keywords":["间隔重复","SuperMemo","记忆稳定性","可提取性","间隔效应"],"summary":"Anki 自行车，SuperMemo 方程式（暴论 2333 https://masterhowtolearn.wordpress.com/ 看过 Anki 手册的人都知道，Anki 是算法是基于 SM-2 的修修补补版。而 SM-2 是一个经验算法，它的提出 [1] (1987年)比 SuperMemo 的双变量记忆模型 […","question_detail_html":"<p>开源实现 supermemo 的成本有多高？</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/410304241/answer/1373468425","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"MT8C1Lvx\">Anki 自行车，SuperMemo 方程式（暴论 2333</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-20971660dc41d19e9c243ee26335c123_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-eec8132e2bf7e4ef26794a991ec1ce24\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-eec8132e2bf7e4ef26794a991ec1ce24_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"747\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-20971660dc41d19e9c243ee26335c123_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-eec8132e2bf7e4ef26794a991ec1ce24\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-eec8132e2bf7e4ef26794a991ec1ce24_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"747\"/><figcaption>https://masterhowtolearn.wordpress.com/</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"DVz0XIzG\">看过 Anki 手册的人都知道，Anki 是算法是基于 SM-2 的修修补补版。而 SM-2 是一个经验算法，它的提出<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>(1987年)比 SuperMemo 的双变量记忆模型<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>(1988年)还早。</p><p data-pid=\"2lAw-s0K\">从现在来看，SM-2 存在理论缺陷：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"YrSFRZRe\"><b>SM-2 的问题</b><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/>SM-2 用 E-factor 同时表示卡片难度和记忆稳定性，即 E-factor 越大卡片越简单，且间隔乘数越大。然而间隔乘数会随着记忆稳定性的增加而下降。这有点像在自行车上使用同一个控制杆来改变档位和方向。<br/>而且，每一个卡片都有自己的 EF，互相不影响，这使得 SM-2 的收敛速度很慢。旧卡片的学习经验不能帮助新卡片收敛。<br/>简单来说<br/>SM2 使用学习者在卡片上的表现来确定下次安排该卡片的时间<br/>SM3 + 会根据学习者在卡片上的表现来确定下一次安排该卡片及类似卡片的时间</blockquote><p data-pid=\"dlpud2uy\">这是从理论上来讲，如果从算法性能指数来比较的话：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"0_J7Bdwn\">这是一个示例性的700,000次重复的初步估计（以下是偏差值，越小越好）：<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Algorithm_SM-17\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">算法SM-17</a>：1.1<br/><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Algorithm_SM-2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">算法SM-2</a>：35.3<br/><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Leitner\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Leitner</a>（标准化）：47.7<br/>Pimsleur（1967）：60.6</blockquote><p data-pid=\"pr-eT0ug\">这是从算法层面来对比，SuperMemo 18 与 Anki 已经是天差地别了。</p><p data-pid=\"1cl0i93I\">如果比较两者的功能的话，那两者的界面对比就能说明一切：</p><p data-pid=\"KQelRUA1\">SuperMemo 是这样的：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a2c60007aa4b034d116752cb828a728a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c06b713a5e88952edbea58bbd89203a2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c06b713a5e88952edbea58bbd89203a2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1536\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a2c60007aa4b034d116752cb828a728a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c06b713a5e88952edbea58bbd89203a2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c06b713a5e88952edbea58bbd89203a2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1536\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"BMAW1Ffj\">Anki 是这样的：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-51d2a41faf96cc80d1fcabb6bdaf9df9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a77aa71b5cf00c367fceb80867ca0566\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a77aa71b5cf00c367fceb80867ca0566_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1920\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-51d2a41faf96cc80d1fcabb6bdaf9df9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a77aa71b5cf00c367fceb80867ca0566\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-a77aa71b5cf00c367fceb80867ca0566_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1920\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"aPoRn4rR\">功能数量完全不在一个量级。。。</p><p data-pid=\"IJDQgogn\">PS: 这里我犯了个错误，如果考虑到 Anki 的插件数量，那就翻转了，Anki 的自由度比 Supermemo 更高。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"Oy6uW5RC\">说到开源 SuperMemo 的成本，我觉得可能能和开源 Word 相比。</p><p data-pid=\"EESc7-JO\">SuperMemo 从 1987 的 DOS 版本诞生，到如今的 SM-18，已经过去近 30 年了。</p><p data-pid=\"Uy1ns90G\">目前我还在继续研究 SuperMemo 的算法，尝试收集一些数据来做验证，大家可以期待一下，结果会发在我的另一个专栏：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-27e7ae6074e0924d0e2f31d97d784b16_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"277\" data-image-width=\"277\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/supermemo-guru-cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo Guru翻译计划</a><p data-pid=\"TStVem7l\">希望我的回答对题主有所帮助。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 04 SuperMemo 1.0: 日志 (1987) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"97887756\" href=\"#/post/97887756\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"99505568\" href=\"#/post/99505568\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> First adaptable spaced repetition algorithm: Algorithm SM-4 <a href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/First_adaptable_spaced_repetition_algorithm:_Algorithm_SM-4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://supermemo.guru/wiki/First_adaptable_spaced_repetition_algori…</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> Universal metric for cross-comparison of spaced repetition algorithms <a href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Universal_metric_for_cross-comparison_of_spaced_repetition_algorithms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Universal_metric_for_cross-comparison_of…</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"99505568","title":"05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":20,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"97887756","title":"04 1987 SuperMemo 1.0: 日志","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":33,"minutes":14,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"205600711","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(上)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":17,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"213170503","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(下)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":30,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"447640544","title":"10 1995：超媒体 SuperMemo","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":23,"minutes":22,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"207094393","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(中)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":18,"minutes":13,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"456205621","title":"11 1997：启用神经网络","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":17,"minutes":38,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1847718575","title":"SuperMemo 算法原理是怎么样的，代码如何实现的？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":23,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 23 赞同"},{"id":"959753274","title":"手机上的anki app 复习的间隔时间可以改吗 在哪里改？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":40,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 40 赞同"},{"id":"1729652349","title":"如何评价Anki插件Auto Ease Factor?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":26,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 26 赞同"},{"id":"1319708582","title":"按遗忘曲线复习效率更高吗？为什么我觉得没什么效果呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":63,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 63 赞同"},{"id":"999630947","title":"背单词时怎样做到背了新单词而不忘背过的旧词？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":12,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 12 赞同"}]}